ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLele and Xiaowei are in an outdoor sports equipment store, choosing climbing gear. They plan to participate in an upcoming climbing course, but they still lack a team member. While they are chatting, they see Qingqing in the park across the street through the glass window of the shop. Qingqing also notices them and waves at them. Lele suddenly smiles at Xiaowei, purses her lips, and points at Qingqing in the park. Xiaowei looks over with interest. Then, Lele gets up and leaves the store, and Xiaowei quickly follows and walks towards Qingqing.\n\n[Question]\nQingqing notices Lele and Xiaowei walking towards her, what is her mood?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Qingqing feels surprised because she does not expect to see them in the park.\nB. Qingqing feels scared, thinking they will invite her to participate in dangerous sports.\nC. Qingqing feels curious, wanting to know what they are buying in the equipment store.\nD. Qingqing feels curious, not knowing why Lele and Xiaowei come out of the outdoor sports equipment store to find her.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694690683470006,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e169d6006945d27ff452","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367849652,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:30:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"712d995c03b746af86ffb197c6bb37de"}